{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00803","headline":"郊庙歌辞 梁太庙乐舞辞 昭德舞 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 梁太庙乐舞辞 昭德舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"肃肃文考，源濬派长。\n汉称诞季，周实生昌。\n奄有四海，超彼百王。\n笙镛迭奏，礼物荧煌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00803.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00803","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}